on Amazon Prime Video.

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:09.609 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here's my conversation
with Janelle Monáe.

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:13.146 align:start size:94% position:6%
Janelle, how are you?
It's lovely to see you again

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:16.583 size:84% position:42%
-Hi, Seth, how are you?
-I'm doing very well.

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:18.418 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is your first time
on the show.

00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:22.022
But we -- I want to say very
quickly, with met in 2010.

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:24.958 align:start size:94% position:6%
I hosted the ESPYs,
and you were the musical act

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:29.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
And never in my life,
when I heard you guys rehearse

00:00:29.396 --> 00:00:30.330 line:92%
had I thought, "Oh, my goodness.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:33.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
