famous, very quickly.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:34.234 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:36.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I don't know
if that's good or bad, Seth.

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:39.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-It was -- it was very good.

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:40.907 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was very good.
-Thank you.

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:43.410 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I wanted to ask,
you pulled off something

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:45.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
