we are living through.

00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:50.650 align:start size:94% position:6%
You did a "Vanity Fair" cove
shoot that is stunning

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you did through Zoom,
which I had no idea

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:56.489 align:start size:94% position:6%
you could have this qualit
of work through Zoom.

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:58.224 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Me either. [ Laughs ]

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:01.761
I was very nervous about going
into it because I'm thinking

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:03.630 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Oh, my goodness.
This is a cover

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:07.400
for "Vanity Fair," a dream
And I couldn't use my glam team.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.202 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, nobody was --
-Yeah.

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:12.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I had to do my own hair,
my own makeup, and you know,

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:15.942
they -- I consulted with my team
like before we start shooting.

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:19.646
But it was an amazing experience
working with Collier,

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:21.181 line:92%
working with all of the women.

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:23.249 align:start size:94% position:6%
A lot of women came together
to pull this shoot,

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:28.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
and one of the notes that th
photographer was saying

00:01:28.555 --> 00:01:30.490 align:start size:94% position:6%
of just how intimate everythin
was, she was like,

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:33.927 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Janelle, you're not breathing
I can feel through the --

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:34.461 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:36.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
I can feel that you're not
breathing. Breathe."

00:01:36.129 --> 00:01:39.332 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so, I mean, it was --
it's, I mean,

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:40.934 align:start size:94% position:6%
what a time we're living in,
right?

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:42.936 size:78% position:39%
-Well, it's so funny,
because, you know,

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:45.805 align:start size:94% position:6%
the thing about photo shoots
is even when a photo

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:47.640 align:start size:94% position:6%
looks intimate, you've bee
on so many,

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.876 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know that there are so man
people standing around.

00:01:49.876 --> 00:01:53.012 align:start size:94% position:6%
And this was a case where,
I don't know,

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:56.149 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, you realize, oh,
this is actually more authenti

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:58.585 align:start size:94% position:6%
via Zoom than it would be
anywhere else.

00:01:58.585 --> 00:02:00.620
It's a really --
they're really wonderful photos.

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:02.889 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, thank you so much.
Thank you.

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:04.624 size:88% position:44% line:92%
It was a dream for sure.

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:07.861
-You -- We obviously know you as
a musician, a singer,

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:10.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
a film actor,
so this is your first --

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:12.832 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Homecoming" is your first
television work.

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:15.635 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is the second season
of a fantastic show.

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:18.171 align:start size:94% position:6%
What drew you to
wanting to do it?

00:02:18.171 --> 00:02:19.739 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I was a fan
of the first season.

00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:23.743 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think we all were so excited
when Julia Roberts

00:02:23.743 --> 00:02:27.213 align:start size:94% position:6%
said she was coming to TV.
And I watched that.

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:28.248 line:92%
I listened to the podcast.

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:32.252 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I just love what it
had to say about, you know

00:02:32.252 --> 00:02:35.155 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
corporate greed,

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:39.826 align:start size:94% position:6%
about corporate greed
and capitalism

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:41.227 line:92%
and the hiding of information.

00:02:41.227 --> 00:02:46.900
I love the fact that this season
I got an opportunity to play

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:49.402
this woman named Jackie,
who wakes up in the middle

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:52.705 size:88% position:44%
of a boat with no clue,
no memory of who she is.

00:02:52.705 --> 00:02:55.308 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so we go on this journey
of self-discovery.

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:59.445
Her uncovering her identity, and
it's a psychological thriller.

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:03.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
It has this Hitchcockian vib
to it.

00:03:03.116 --> 00:03:06.252 size:78% position:39% line:92%
The music, the score,

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:09.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
just everything
that it had to say

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:13.259 align:start size:94% position:6%
felt so timely and was don
so artfully

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:16.029 align:start size:94% position:6%
that it just feels like
an outlier in TV.

00:03:16.029 --> 00:03:17.830 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so, it just made me --
it made me

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:20.667 align:start size:94% position:6%
want to be a part of the show.
-It is a wonderful show.

00:03:20.667 --> 00:03:26.139 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's a wonderful mystery.
And I love a 30-minute drama

00:03:26.139 --> 00:03:28.274 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't want to make it soun
like --

00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:30.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
-I don't love hour-long dramas

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:32.979 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-But I feel in a interesting

00:03:32.979 --> 00:03:33.646 size:75% position:38% line:92%
narrative structure.

00:03:33.646 --> 00:03:35.782
It has great cliff hangars
And I highly recommend it.

00:03:35.782 --> 00:03:40.119 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my goodness. Listen,
that means so much from you.

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:42.088 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ]

